                                "example_id": "f28d1bc1-f606-43de-8920-b67376a31ac4",
                                "sense_id": "ff9fb76b-2321-3da0-886b-fb52c1101fae",
                                "text": "Then \"G. A. R.\" did shoulder his burden and with much labor made footprints for a hostelry afar off, where he might put it in for safe keeping, while the venders of papers and the ragged blackers of boots followed in his train and pelted him […]"
